---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const link =
    "text-fg underline decoration-fg-faint underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:decoration-fg";
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy Policy | coolLabs"
    canonicalUrl="https://coolify.io/privacy-policy/"
    description="Privacy policy for Coolify and coolLabs services. Learn how we protect your data and respect your privacy."
>
    <h1
        class="px-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg md:text-5xl"
    >
        Privacy policy<span class="text-warning">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl px-4 text-base text-pretty text-fg-dim">
        How coolLabs protects your data and respects your privacy.
    </p>

    <article
        class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 text-left text-[15px] leading-7 text-fg-dim
        [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:text-fg
        [&_p]:mt-3 [&_strong]:font-medium [&_strong]:text-fg
        [&_ul]:mt-3 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_li]:marker:text-fg-faint"
    >
        <p class="!mt-0 border-b border-hairline pb-6 text-xs text-fg-faint">
            Last updated: <time datetime="2025-03-23">March 23, 2025</time>
        </p>

        <section>
            <h2>Overview</h2>
            <p>
                At coolLabs Solutions Kft. ("we", "us", or "our"), we create
                services and applications ("products") under the domains
                coollabs.io, coolify.io, images.coollabs.io, safetyper.com, and
                all subdomains, as well as potentially other services we may
                launch. Our goal is to provide a secure place for your online
                information, and we own and operate these platforms. We are
                committed to not transferring your data to any external company
                unless required by law.
            </p>
            <p>
                Our products may include links to external sites not operated by
                us. Please be aware that we have no control over their content or
                privacy practices, and this policy does not apply to them.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>What information we collect</h2>
            <p>
                To make our products functional, we collect only the following
                basic information during registration:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your email address</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                We don't collect anything beyond what's necessary for our
                services, and we anonymize data whenever technically possible.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How we use your information</h2>
            <p>We use your email address to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage your account</li>
                <li>Communicate with you about your account or our services</li>
                <li>Send optional updates or promotions (only with your consent)</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Legal basis for processing</h2>
            <p>We process your email address based on:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Consent</strong>: You agree to this when you
                    register, and you can withdraw consent anytime
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Contract</strong>: It's necessary to provide the
                    services you've requested
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How we protect your information</h2>
            <p>
                We store your email address securely on servers within the
                European Union, using encryption and access controls to prevent
                unauthorized access. If we ever need to transfer your data
                outside the EU (e.g., for backups or service providers), we'll
                ensure safeguards like standard contractual clauses are in place
                to protect it, as required by GDPR.
            </p>
            <p>
                We keep your data only as long as necessary to provide the
                services you've requested or as required by law. Once you delete
                your account or no longer use our services, we retain your email
                address for a short period (e.g., 30 days) for administrative
                purposes, then securely delete it.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
            <p>We do not share your information with third parties, except:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    When legally required (e.g., by a court order or regulation)
                </li>
                <li>
                    With trusted service providers (e.g., hosting or email
                    services) who process data on our behalf, under strict data
                    protection agreements
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>You have control over your data. Under GDPR, you can:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Access</strong>: Request a copy of your data</li>
                <li><strong>Correct</strong>: Update inaccurate information</li>
                <li><strong>Delete</strong>: Remove your data from our servers</li>
                <li><strong>Restrict</strong>: Limit how we use your data</li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Portability</strong>: Get your data in a usable format
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Object</strong>: Stop processing (e.g., for marketing)
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                To exercise these rights or withdraw consent, use the deletion
                option in our products or contact us.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you're unhappy with how we handle your data, you have the
                right to lodge a complaint with your local supervisory authority
                (e.g., in Hungary, the National Authority for Data Protection and
                Freedom of Information –
                <a href="https://www.naih.hu/" class={link}>NAIH</a>).
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Contact us</h2>
            <p>Questions about data handling? Reach out to us:</p>
            <ul class="!list-none !pl-0">
                <li>
                    <strong>Email</strong>:
                    <a href="mailto:security@coollabs.io" class={link}
                        >security@coollabs.io</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>More info</strong>:
                    <a href="https://coolify.io/docs/contact" class={link}
                        >https://coolify.io/docs/contact</a
                    >
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
                If we update this policy, we'll post the new version on our
                websites (coollabs.io, coolify.io, images.coollabs.io,
                safetyper.com, etc.) and notify you via email or within our
                products. Continued use of our services means you accept the
                updated policy.
            </p>
        </section>

        <p class="!mt-12 border-t border-hairline pt-6 text-fg-faint">
            By using our products, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
        </p>
    </article>
</Layout>
